Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎收看《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:08.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出事了。是玛丽。她不知怎么上了屋顶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something's wrong. It's Mary. Somehow, she got on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:09.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快把手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me your hand right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:13.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽！等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的一位嘉宾去世了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One of our cast members passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:19.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来联系法务部。家属那边我们来处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna call Legal. We'll deal with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这事我要压得滴水不漏，听明白了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I want to zip this thing up air tight. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不开灯，不拍摄，不录。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No lights, no camera, no action.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.29,0:00:25.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整季都挺邪门的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whole season's been kind of freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我第一次做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's my first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:28.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我们应该推迟婚礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe we should postpone the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:30.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是因为瑞秋。也许吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is about Rachel. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:33.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有太多你看不到的东西。这……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is just so much that you don't see. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:35.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于你，我看到的比你想象的多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When it comes to you, I see more than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:41.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回家吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coming home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:46.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚离开我妻子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just left my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:01:00.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在海滩上，一丝不挂，我们正在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were on the beach, stark naked, and we were in...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:03.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我们正做到一半……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, we were in the middle of... of doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:05.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}突然，到处都是灯光，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And suddenly, there were lights everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直直地照在我们身上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just shining down at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:09.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是观鸟俱乐部。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was the birding club.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:14.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凌晨五点，16个老太太直勾勾盯着我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}16 old ladies just staring us down at 5:00 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:17.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这辈子最丢人的一刻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The most embarrassing moment of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.51,0:01:20.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都不知道你怎么做到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even know how you would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:22.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不喜欢满沙滩的沙子做爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't like having sex on the beach with all that sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:24.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，床就是干这个用的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's what beds are for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:27.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，悠着点，小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, easy, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你身边有那么多玩具可以玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got enough toys around here to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:32.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不要玩具。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want the toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.23,0:01:35.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候男人想要个成年人正眼看他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes a man wants a grown-up to look him in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:39.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，地狱里的人……也想要冰水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and people in Hell... They want ice water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.27,0:01:41.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.67,0:01:44.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}殿下他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His royal highness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.34,0:01:46.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么早就让你给他擦屁股。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}has you wiping his ass awfully early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:48.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，他，呃，刚借了我的手机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, he was, uh, just borrowing my cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.91,0:01:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜他得打给他的律师\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think he had to call his lawyer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:52.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈酒庄什么的。我完全不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about the vineyard or something. I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:55.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.38,0:01:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，呃，听着，我们……我们有个问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, um, look, we... we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.92,0:01:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？怎么了？就是，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What happened? It's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直忍不住想那天晚上的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't stop thinking about the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……算你倒霉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that... sucks for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:08.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该直接告诉你未婚妻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should just tell your fiancée about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，呃，听着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, uh, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？这……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:13.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……我们不是故意的，好吗？我们当时都懵了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It... We didn't mean it, okay? We were in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.87,0:02:16.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？控制室。所以只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel? Control room. So it was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:17.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有大日子。我正飞过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got a big day. I'm flying in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:19.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得挂了。奎恩要疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to go. Quinn's freaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:21.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们还没说完。我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're not done, though. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们回头再谈。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're talking later. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.95,0:02:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人们说每朵乌云都有银边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They say that every cloud has a silver lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:34.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们《永恒》节目组相信这是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we here at "Everlasting" believe that to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:37.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果玛丽·纽豪斯不幸离世的悲剧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If the tragedy of Mary Newhouse's untimely death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教会了我们什么，那就是生命转瞬即逝……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}has taught us anything, it's that life is fleeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他拿把伞干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is he doing with an umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又没下雨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not even raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停！停！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut! Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:50.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这破词谁写的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who wrote this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:52.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太沉重、太压抑了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just too much doom and gloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:53.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我的错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会调整，然后给格雷厄姆提意见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll adjust and give the note to Graham.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:57.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，嘿，终于好了。好，来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hey, finally. All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:02:59.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}死亡这块我们够了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are done with death, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:02.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我浪漫，浪漫，浪漫！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me romance, romance, romance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:04.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让这节目回到它的本质上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get this show back to what it's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真爱，宝贝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}True love, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，大家冷静点。冷静点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's keep it cool, guys. Let's keep it cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:16.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有点恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's kind of disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:18.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。谢谢。好了好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Thank you. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:20.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这周安排水疗约会，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This week, it is spa dates, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们还剩四个女孩……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've got four girls left...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:24.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜、菲丝、格蕾丝和莎米夸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna, Faith, Grace, and Shamiqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:26.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来点刺激的。让全美国都猜不透。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's heat things up. Let's keep America guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧，没人猜不透。那小子明显要选格蕾丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, nobody is guessing. That boy is going for Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.88,0:03:30.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又不能确定。亲爱的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know that for sure. Honey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:32.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你不……我可能是同性恋，但我知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you don't... I may be gay, but I know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:34.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直男喜欢什么样的妹子，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what kind of punani straight boys like, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我同意这家伙。格蕾丝有嘴唇有身材，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm with homeboy. Grace has the lips and the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且她能数到10……我觉得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and she can count to 10... I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不重要，10。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That one's not even important, 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜绝对是个抢手货。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna's a total catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她漂亮，以优异成绩毕业\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's beautiful, she graduated magna cum laude
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从布朗大学之类的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from, like, Brown or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:48.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当也没你想的那么肤浅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Adam is not as shallow as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就是没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's just not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有你这么认为。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}According to nobody but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:53.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我们先别管谁是领跑者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's just forget who the front-runner is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要一场赛马。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a horse race.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:56.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，杰，我们得把莎米夸推上去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Jay, we need to amp up Shamiqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:58.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要少点脑子，多点胸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want less brains and I want more cleavage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}交给我。好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got it. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.37,0:04:01.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，瑞秋，我不知道拿菲丝怎么办，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, Rachel, I don't know what to do with Faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:03.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们得让亚当对她着迷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we've got to make her hot for Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有安娜……安娜得放开点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Anna... Anna's got to loosen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.61,0:04:08.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。玩开心点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露点肉，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Show some skin, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当想要的是出门像淑女、上床像荡妇的那种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam wants a lady on the street but a freak in the sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:15.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Capiche?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:19.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们还有三集时间让他求婚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got three more episodes to get him to propose
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:20.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向这些傻姑娘中的一个求婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to one of these ding-dongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰了，威尔顿先生。非常抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, Mr. Wilton. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你妻子来了。前妻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your wife is here. Ex-wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.63,0:04:26.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来得还不够快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.07,0:04:28.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你们可以用我的办公室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, you guys can use my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.34,0:04:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟，你可真大方，奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My, that's so generous of you, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:38.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟我的律师谈过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I talked to my lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.35,0:04:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真了不起。"了不起"说得没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bully for you. "Bully" is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:43.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以离婚，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can have your divorce, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:47.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我要拿走你每一分钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I am gonna take you for every penny you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我收拾完你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the time I'm done with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就得住到商业市的单间公寓里去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you are gonna be living in a single in the City of Commerce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:53.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加州是夫妻共同财产州。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Cali's a community-property state.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会拿到你那一半。你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll get your half. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能喝酒。你怀孕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't drink. You're pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:04:59.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧。我这年纪，五五开，反正也是个畸形儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please. At my age, 50/50, it's a flipper baby anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，我会拿到我那一半。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And yeah, I will get my half.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:05.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这个小杂耍玩意儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this little sideshow attraction
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会拿走其余的一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}gonna get everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抚养费会把你榨干。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Child support's gonna take you to the cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.11,0:05:12.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要是你，就考虑缩减开支。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd think about downsizing if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:13.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我的律师\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, my lawyers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会一步步跟你死磕，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}are gonna fight you every step of the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的律师再跟我的律师死磕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and your lawyers are gonna fight my lawyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，那就开始吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm, let the games begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:21.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱俩都得付给律师几百万……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we're both gonna be paying those lawyers millions...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:23.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱俩都损失几百万。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Millions we both lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:26.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:29.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在就在这儿谈个协议。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We cut a deal, right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:31.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让律师掺和。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave the lawyers out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:34.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太感谢了。我很感激。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks so much. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:37.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好啊。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, hello. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:39.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。为美好的夜晚干杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Here's to a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，还有几乎不睡觉。嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, and very little sleep. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:43.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你真睡着的时候……嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When you do sleep... Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:44.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你动作可真多。你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're very active. Do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你流口水，还打呼噜。就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You drool and you snore a lot. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算你走运。算你走运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lucky you. Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，那个，听着……今天，我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, so, look... Today, I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你拿出最佳状态。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna need you to bring your "A" game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:55.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的最佳状态？来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My "A" game? Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个女人死后才三天。我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three days after a woman died. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:58.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别怪，但你了解奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's super weird, but you know Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:00.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不喜欢沉浸在情绪之类的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's doesn't like to linger on feelings or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.03,0:06:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:04.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沉浸在情绪里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lingering?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的专长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:11.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，她想要点浪漫来清清口味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, she wants a little romance to cleanse the palate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我能办到。不是我，罗密欧。是他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I can do that. Not me, Romeo. Them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get on out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:22.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都觉得这事很怪吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You all feel weird about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？节目？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? The show?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:26.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。我是说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:27.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽那些事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary and all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:30.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就……在这儿瞎混，玩得开心？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we're just... here, goofing off, having a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，很难，但退出节目\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it's hard, but what's quitting the show
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:35.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者蜷成一团又对谁有好处？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or curling up in a ball gonna do for anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸死后要是我待在家里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I had stayed home after my dad died,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会靠吃东西发泄情绪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would be eating my feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上哭着睡着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and crying myself to sleep at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少在节目里，我还在做事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least on the show, I'm doing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:46.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保持忙碌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm staying busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你真觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, do you really think
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:50.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽会希望我们退出吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that Mary would've wanted us to quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:54.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}作为这个系列的老手，我们演艺圈有句话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As a veteran of this series, there's a little saying
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:07:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……"演出必须继续。"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we have in showbiz... "The show must go on."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而至于你们寻找永恒真爱的旅程，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And in the case of your quest for everlasting love,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这寻找也必须继续。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the search must go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十三季了，你就这点东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After 13 seasons, that's all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.73,0:07:14.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，还有一座艾美奖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that and an Emmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错！呼！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes! Hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。五千万美元？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. $50 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.51,0:07:28.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当时怎么想的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:29.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:32.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我们不再谈那事了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought we weren't gonna talk about that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.25,0:07:33.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:36.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，那笔钱我也拼了命赚来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I worked really hard for that money, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:37.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那她干了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what did she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在Whole Foods和Lululemon购物？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She shopped at Whole Foods and Lululemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你一样不喜欢这事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I don't like it any more than you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:45.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但至少它为你我扫清了障碍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but at least it clears the way for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:47.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，大概吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:49.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实还挺甜的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's actually sort of sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为了小小的我放弃五千万。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you giving away 50 mil for little, old me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你值每一分钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you are worth every cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:56.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我们很快就能把钱赚回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, we'll make that cash back in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.54,0:07:58.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只要开始卖些节目就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All we have to do is start selling some shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:07:59.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，说曹操曹操到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:03.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布拉德来了。最棒的是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's Brad. And the best part?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:04.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布伦特伍德的邪恶女巫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Wicked Witch of Brentwood
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:07.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从今往后我们赚的钱，她一分都碰不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}won't be able to touch a cent we make from here on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，等一下。呼！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, hold on. Hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:13.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，开始吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:14.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！你好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's everyone holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:21.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，最近……是有点难熬，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, it's... It's been a little tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.17,0:08:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们挺过来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we're getting through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我心里很难受。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... I feel terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过昨晚那收视率可真是猛啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But how about those monster numbers last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.91,0:08:29.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:32.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，6.8……比上周涨了22%。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, 6.8... Up 22% from last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:33.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:35.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，人应该多死几次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, people should die more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道！简直难以置信！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know! Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:39.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她孩子……她孩子怎么样了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's, uh, how's her kid doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该挺好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:45.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}管理层对这收视率乐坏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Management is thrilled with these numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们想趁热打铁，你听听这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They want to capitalize on the momentum, so get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们想让这一季以克伦威尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They want to end the season with Cromwell
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在直播中娶了其中一个姑娘收尾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}marrying one of these chicks, live, on air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也就是说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So we're talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:08:58.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一场两小时的《永恒》婚礼特别节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a two-hour special "Everlasting" wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.21,0:09:00.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这难道不是天才吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, is that not genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.61,0:09:02.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们能办到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you guys make that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不如我们再进一步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if we take it one step further
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:06.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用这场婚礼给下一季的衍生剧做铺垫？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and use the wedding to backdoor a spin-off for next season?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.95,0:09:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.95,0:09:10.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后……然后我们让亚当和他的新娘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And... and, uh, we have Adam and his new bride,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:13.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}适应英国上流社会的生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}um, adjusting to the upper-crust life in the U.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:14.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就叫《皇室之恋》。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll call it "Royal Love." Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.89,0:09:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了！我跟你说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweet! I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:18.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让他娶那个墨西哥比基尼模特，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get him to marry the Mexican bikini model,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这买卖就成了，怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you've got yourselves a deal, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.19,0:09:22.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她能带来西语电视台的观众。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'll bring in the Telemundo audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:23.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜拜！搞定！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye! Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:27.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才像话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}强强联手，你和我。天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Synergy. You and me. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们很快就能把那五千万翻倍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna double that 50 mil in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，我没听懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait. So, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说我已经赢了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you saying that I've already won?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是很好吗？你觉得呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't that great? What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:50.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}娶这么一位美丽、异域风情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shouldn't be so hard to be married
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:52.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又迷人的女人，应该不难吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to such a beautiful, exotic, and compelling woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:55.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……这提议可真不小。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, that's... That's quite a proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:58.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，所以这档节目……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, so, on this show...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:00.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—《皇室之恋》。  -—哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-"Royal Love."   -Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.27,0:10:01.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢这名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love how that sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，格蕾丝和我……我们要结婚？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, uh, Grace and I... We're gonna be married?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.67,0:10:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你是在《永恒》里结婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. You'll be married on "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:06.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在最后一集求婚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll propose in the final episode,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们做两小时特别节目\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then we'll do a two-hour special
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}介绍衍生剧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when we introduce the spin-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:13.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}衍生剧。太激动人心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A spin-off. So exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，确实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:16.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴你们俩都同意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So glad you two are on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，我们可以让格蕾丝下来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, we're ready for Grace now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:21.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，收到。我让她下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Copy that. I'm sending her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，这事先别声张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. So, just keep this under your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们告诉你这些的唯一原因\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The only reason why we're telling you this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是需要你们俩签同意书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is 'cause we need you two to sign releases.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情进展得飞快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thing's moving at warp speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:30.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就当我已经签了。好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Consider me signed. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:32.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会准备好文件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll draw up the paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:33.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。谢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.33,0:10:34.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，奎恩……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Quinn, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.87,0:10:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你去办之前……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before you do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧，老大？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:40.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事，听着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, look. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别误会，格蕾丝是个好姑娘，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't get me wrong, Grace is a lovely girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你的提议太荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but what you're suggesting is absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只签了这一季。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I signed on for one season of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.35,0:10:49.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一季，就这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One season, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:51.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我不打算再待一季，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And look, I don't intend to stick around for another,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:54.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，另找个替罪羊吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so, I mean, find yourself another patsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:05.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“您的房子真漂亮，爵爷。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"What a lovely house you have, Your Lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“非常感谢您邀请我。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you so much for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:11.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“嗯，能来这里真好。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. So nice to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:12.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“很高兴见到您。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我叫格蕾丝……格蕾丝·克伦威尔。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My name is Grace... Grace Cromwell."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在练口音啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Practicing your accent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你睫毛膏花了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your mascara's smudged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:30.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真觉得他会选你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you really think he's gonna pick you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}骚货会被淘汰……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sluts get cut...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听到的是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or that's what I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:39.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，我知道他会选我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey, I know he's gonna pick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:41.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都安排好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:44.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这话什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:47.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}压力来了，姑娘们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pressure is on, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.14,0:11:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然玛雅遗憾地——当然——决定退出节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, since Maya sadly decided to, of course, leave the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们每个人都进了四强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}each of you have made it to the final four.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:56.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们知道这几周对大家都是很大的压力，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We know it has been stressful for all of us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:12:00.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以给你们一个机会和亚当一起放松\N{\rEN\blur0.8}these past few weeks, which is why we're giving you a chance to relax with Adam
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:03.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在一个宁静的禅意天堂里恢复元气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and rejuvenate at a tranquil zen paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:04.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜。安娜，嗨。笑一个，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna. Anna, hi. Smile, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我身后是蜡烛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Behind me are candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:09.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些蜡烛每一根都象征着你炽热的渴望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Each one of these candles is a symbol of your burning desire
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:11.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想要赢得亚当的心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to win Adam's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:12.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:14.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都顺利吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything hunky-dory?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，顺利得不能再顺利了。你有空吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, hunkiest-doriest. You got a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:19.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这会儿有点忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm kind of in the middle of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.27,0:12:21.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。那现在对我来说正好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Now's good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，卡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家休息五分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody take five, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.55,0:12:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘘。沙米夸，过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, psst. Shamiqua, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你在这件事上站我这边，对吧？真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you're with me on this, right? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撑了这么多周，就落到这个地步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is what it's come to after hanging in there for weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.33,0:12:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还经历了一场自杀？现在就变成“露胸”了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}through a suicide? Now it's "flash them titties"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.10,0:12:45.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:47.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，你得给我点东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, you've got to give me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:48.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然我俩都回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or we both go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:52.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我最后的女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're my last girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.11,0:12:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你凭什么觉得我能扭转亚当的想法？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what makes you think I can even turn Adam around?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:12:58.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，他本来就不想上这个节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, he didn't want to do this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:12:59.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我们的英国佬驯服师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're our limey whisperer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，听着。那是以前。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, listen. That was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们当时没让他签约娶这些女孩之一。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We weren't asking him to sign on and marry one of these girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:06.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。我们说的是一年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. We're talking about a year here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:08.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后他们来个又大又劲爆的离婚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then they get a big, juicy divorce,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.09,0:13:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}登上各大八卦小报。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}splash it all over the tabloids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.86,0:13:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便他们搞多少个D咖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw all the D-listers they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:14.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那假设我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So let's say that I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假设我能行，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's say that I can, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:18.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假设我能扭转他的想法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's say I can turn him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:20.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我有什么好处？就耍耍手段？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's in it for me? Wheeling and dealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:22.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，熊妈妈教得真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Mama Bear taught you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是说，你要做衍生剧了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just saying, you are getting a spin-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:26.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他多一年时间推销他的酒庄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's getting another year to promote his vineyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧好吧，行。你想要什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, all right, fine. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}中东和平。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Peace in the Middle East.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:34.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一艘装满小马的帆船？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A sailboat full of ponies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:36.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}普通小马，还是迷你马？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Regular, miniature ponies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:37.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续。还是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Continue. Or?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自己的节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My own show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:43.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。接手《皇室之恋》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Take "Royal Love."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。绝对不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Just flat-out no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:49.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会夹在你和奎恩中间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna get in between you and Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，奎恩现在站我这边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Quinn's with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，她在战壕里待够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, she's done her time in the trenches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轮到你没有生活了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your turn to not have a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。你怎么说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:59.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从底层小工到执行制作人，一眨眼的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grunt to executive producer, blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:01.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可是千载难逢的交易。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a deal of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只要搞定亚当就行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All I have to do is deliver Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:07.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用银盘端上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, on a silver platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.25,0:14:09.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:10.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。嘿，亚当！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Hey, Adam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:12.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当，我能跟你说句话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam, can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。我，呃，想跟你谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. I, uh, wanted to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我猜猜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:19.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于《皇室之恋》，这部荒唐的衍生剧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About "Royal Love," this ludicrous spin-off
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:21.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特和奎恩想拉我入伙的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet and Quinn are trying to rope me into?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.43,0:14:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚听说，是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just heard about it, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些人疯了。我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These people are mad. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结婚从来就不是协议的一部分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A marriage was never part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:28.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，就一年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, it's only for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我们就……我们就结个婚，装装样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, we'll just... we'll just get married and just fake it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。真棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course. Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我绝不会对其中任何一个女孩做这种事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would never do that to one of these girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}信不信由你，我对她们还是有一点尊重的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Believe it or not, I actually have a modicum of respect for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我迫不及待想离开这鬼地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I can't wait to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:40.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。收到，伙计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Copy that, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只剩三周了，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's only three more weeks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我，我在数着日子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me, I'm counting the days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:49.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}副导演们，换二号机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A.D.s, go to two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:57.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《皇室之恋》？真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Royal Love"? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁告诉你的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:01.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一只有着翘臀和深喉的小鸟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little bird with a great ass and a deep throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:04.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝真是个白痴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace is such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:07.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，所以我才该赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, which is why I should be the one who wins this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:09.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你看，我甚至不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Look, I don't even know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:11.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们一开始为什么找上她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why they went to her in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:13.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，他们勾搭或者什么的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, they hook up or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:16.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但亚当来参加我父亲的葬礼是有原因的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but Adam came to my father's funeral for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？我们有真正的联系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? We have a real connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:22.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你会……你会很棒的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think that you would... You would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:25.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对亚当来说比格蕾丝好太多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You would be so much better than Grace for Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，如果由我决定，那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, if it were up to me, it would...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那绝对会是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would definitely be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的想要吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you really want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:37.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我这边可以搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I can work it on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:40.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你得去搞定亚当，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you're just gonna have to work it with Adam, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让他想要你，然后拉他入伙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You make him want you and then get him on board with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那格蕾丝怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what about Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:47.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.15,0:15:48.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你专注你未来的丈夫，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You focus on your future husband, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:50.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，怎么样？我们成交了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what's up? We have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。成交。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们每位参赛者都有机会体验\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, each of our contestants gets a chance to experience
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:10.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和亚当单独做一次水疗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}an individual spa treatment with Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:12.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去看看进展如何吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see how it's going, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:14.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.21,0:16:15.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好主意，多露点皮肤。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great idea, showing a little more skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:18.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要涨的可不止收视率。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ratings aren't the only thing that're gonna be going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:21.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}软组织按摩。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Soft-tissue massage. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:23.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}软组织。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Soft tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.22,0:16:24.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.48,0:16:25.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.82,0:16:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。先生，先从我的背开始吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah. Just start with my back first, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:30.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看你有多大本事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll see how far you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:33.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漂亮，黑色的扫兴玩意儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beautiful, black boner killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:38.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}药用泥几个世纪以来一直被用作疗养疗法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Medicinal mud has been used for centuries as a healing regimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你想让我们把这泥巴涂满全身？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you want us to rub this dirt all over ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:47.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泥能打开毛孔，放松身体，焕发活力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The mud opens the pores to relax and invigorate the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:52.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯，真性感。  -哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mm. Sexy.   -Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Check him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.16,0:17:06.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:10.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得焕发活力了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you feel invigorated?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:12.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？你就这么干？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? That's what you're gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:15.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。嗯。不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Mm. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢这样？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:21.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！现在谁有活力了？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Who's invigorated now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:23.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我感觉好有活力！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I feel so alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:25.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:28.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！你喜欢吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! You like it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢这样？！对！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You like that?! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停，拜托，停。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut, please, cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.75,0:17:35.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雪松酶浴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cedar enzyme bath
