Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.71,0:22:22.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她读过的每一个童话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every single fairy tale she's read
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.58,0:22:24.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概从她三岁起吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}since she was about I would say 3 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.14,0:22:26.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}葡萄酒？好，好，太感谢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wine? Yes, yes, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.78,0:22:27.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是让你考虑一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am just telling you to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会得到你想要的一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You would be getting everything you wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你签约参加节目时想要的一切，那些曝光度。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you signed on for the show, all of that exposure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很多人都把那个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So many people have taken that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:38.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个真人秀电视时刻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That reality-show TV moment
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:40.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}变成了正经事业。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and turned it into something legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.86,0:22:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.99,0:22:43.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正的瑞秋在附近吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is the real Rachel anywhere nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我认不出眼前这个傀儡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I don't recognize this golem in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.03,0:22:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能从中得到什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you getting out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:55.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会成为节目统筹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would be the showrunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.81,0:22:57.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:22:58.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我整个职业生涯都想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's everything I wanted my entire career.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.88,0:23:00.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从什么时候开始？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.15,0:23:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚你还在说写小说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last night, you were talking about writing novels
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.55,0:23:03.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和拯救非洲的艾滋病婴儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and saving African AIDS babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:06.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些只是我的梦想。这才是我的现实生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those are just my dreams. This is my actual life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:07.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你在利用我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you're using me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.72,0:23:09.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我在利用你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:10.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当我被利用时……嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I get used... Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.62,0:23:11.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢拿到高额报酬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like to get paid a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:13.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这笔交易对我来说不够。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This deal's not cutting it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.86,0:23:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再在真人秀里待一年，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Another year on a reality TV show,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.90,0:23:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}任他们摆布？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}dancing for the organ grinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:20.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能。再说，你和我一样清楚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No way. Besides, you know as well as I do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.13,0:23:22.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这么做是为了远离我的家人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did this so I could get away from my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.74,0:23:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要是拍这部无聊的《皇家之恋》，就回到原点了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do this insipid "Royal Love," I'm back where I started,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.77,0:23:28.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只会让他们有更多嘲笑我的把柄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}only with more for them to ridicule me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.17,0:23:30.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我只是让你考虑一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I'm just telling you to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:33.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这婚姻不会是真实的。你可以申请撤销。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The marriage wouldn't be real. You could have it annulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它会是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.71,0:23:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可能会让你吃惊，瑞秋，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This may shock you, Rachel,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.55,0:23:39.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但婚姻对我来说确实有意义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but marriage actually means something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:54.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这到底是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.07,0:23:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，瑞秋，杰，为什么别墅布置好了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Rachel, Jay, why is the mansion prepped?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.07,0:23:59.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}淘汰仪式是明天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The elimination ceremony is tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.71,0:24:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！回答我！行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it! Answer! All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.57,0:24:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。这全都不对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. This is all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.28,0:24:07.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者……也许刚刚好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or... maybe it's just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:15.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去看看？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shall we check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.52,0:24:16.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.26,0:24:20.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。哦，我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:21.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.63,0:24:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}法式蛙腿串。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cuisse de grenouilles sur un baton.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.56,0:24:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}棍子上的蛙腿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Frog legs on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.57,0:24:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}青蛙。不是吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Frog. No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.60,0:24:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.61,0:24:36.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这整件事……太过头了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This whole thing is... is too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.68,0:24:39.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一定花了你一大笔钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This must've cost you a mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.14,0:24:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今天早上放弃了五千万美元。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You gave away $50 million this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.65,0:24:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想谈钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to talk about money.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.12,0:24:47.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想谈你……和我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to talk about you... And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.89,0:24:50.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唯一重要的是我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The only thing that matters is us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.02,0:24:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会赚钱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.86,0:24:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《皇室之爱》什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Royal Love," whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.24,0:25:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.75,0:25:23.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轮到你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.02,0:25:25.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你还没离婚呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you're not even divorced yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.02,0:25:29.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说等文件一到，咱们就办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I say as soon as the papers come in, let's just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.13,0:25:32.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再等了，八年了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to wait anymore, not after eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.64,0:25:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意嫁给我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.68,0:25:50.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}管他呢。愿意，愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw it. Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.18,0:25:55.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们结婚吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.68,0:26:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你记得我们之前谈过的那件事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you know that thing that we were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.15,0:26:27.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。对，那事成不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-huh. Yeah, it's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.26,0:26:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.76,0:26:34.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和亚当拍《皇室之爱》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Royal Love," with Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.89,0:26:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没兴趣。哦，好吧……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not into it. Oh. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.43,0:26:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会有兴趣的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.83,0:26:40.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只要给他一个合适的理由。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just got to give him the right reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.00,0:26:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样。我信你。知道为什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's all. I trust you. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.97,0:26:46.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你是个赢家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.37,0:26:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢你的信任，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you very much for the vote of confidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.41,0:26:52.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他真的挺不在状态的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but he really is pretty out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.24,0:26:54.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我见过你巅峰时的样子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I've seen you at the top of your game,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.25,0:26:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我相信你能做到。这次不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I think you're gonna deliver. Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.85,0:26:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。另外，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. P.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.32,0:27:01.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在怀疑自己的能力，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're doubting your own powers, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.72,0:27:03.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小怪胎。跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Creepy, little kid. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.92,0:27:05.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你看样东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.26,0:27:09.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦吼吼！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.13,0:27:13.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。你感觉到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Oh, you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.20,0:27:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是掌控一切、当老板的感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is what it's like to be in control, to be the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.14,0:27:20.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你控制这台机器。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You control the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.41,0:27:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让它怎样就怎样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can make it do whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.41,0:27:31.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们带她兜一圈怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you say we take her for a spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.92,0:27:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.76,0:27:45.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个……听我说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, um... Listen, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.30,0:27:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我们一直吵来吵去，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know we've been going 'round and 'round, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.44,0:27:54.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我其实觉得你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I actually think you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.14,0:27:55.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们确实进展太快了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have been moving too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.91,0:27:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说过我不是那个意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I-I told you I didn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.08,0:28:01.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是心烦、迷茫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just upset, confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.21,0:28:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，你和瑞秋……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you and Rachel have...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.19,0:28:09.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.12,0:28:13.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.06,0:28:17.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们计划好了，杰，要一起生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have plans, Jer, for a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:20.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋她……说来就来说走就走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, she's... she's there, and then she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.33,0:28:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她很会演，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She puts on a good show,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.90,0:28:25.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她除了自己谁都不在乎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but she doesn't give a damn about anybody but herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你值得一个全心全意爱你的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, you deserve someone who's gonna love you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.21,0:28:33.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懂吗？没有遗憾……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know? No regrets...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:35.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毫无保留。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}no holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.02,0:28:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.22,0:28:41.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……我不是那种人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just... I'm not that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.16,0:28:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很爽吧？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's fun, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.03,0:28:52.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，挺酷的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it's pretty awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.43,0:28:55.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这对我来说是家常便饭……生活、节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is every day for me... The life, the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.13,0:28:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全都以每小时80英里的速度朝我冲来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's all coming at me at 80 miles per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.57,0:28:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.97,0:29:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我都能应付，哪怕很吓人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I make it work, even when it gets scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.37,0:29:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实吓人。嘿，切特，你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which it does. Hey, Chet, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.11,0:29:05.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别推我的腿！比你想象的还吓人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop pushing my leg! More than you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.94,0:29:08.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.52,0:29:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我虽然总骂你，瑞秋，但我喜欢你这点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, as much shit as I give you, Rachel, I love you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.45,0:29:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我真不喜欢这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know something, I really don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.12,0:29:16.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想成功，瑞秋，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you really want to make it, Rachel,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就得敢把车开到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you got to be willing to drive the car
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.49,0:29:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它能跑的最快速度。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as fast as it'll take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.09,0:29:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪怕你感觉快要撞毁烧起来了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even when you feel this close to crashing and burning,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.89,0:29:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也得继续开！切特，放开我的腿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you've got to just keep driving! Chet, let go of my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.60,0:29:28.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么你做不到的，瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing you can't do, Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.20,0:29:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么！切特！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing! Chet!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.58,0:29:40.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎，教训学到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, well, lesson learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.85,0:29:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真希望我像你这么大时也有人这么对我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wish someone had done that for me when I was your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.28,0:29:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在……去把亚当给我找来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now... go get me Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.94,0:30:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些数字太低了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These numbers are too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.87,0:30:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些数字太高了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These numbers are too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.27,0:30:08.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些数字加起来不等于这个总数。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These numbers don't equal this total.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.21,0:30:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以做这个的人不是嗑了就是半睡半醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So whoever did this must've been high or half asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.98,0:30:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.12,0:30:17.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.48,0:30:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样吧，你就去……去……去把它修好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? Just go... go... Go get it fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.28,0:30:21.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管你怎么办，修好就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care how you do it. Just get it fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.12,0:30:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，刚才那是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, what was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.89,0:30:25.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些人就是需要被提醒一下自己的权力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, some people just need to be reminded of their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.89,0:30:27.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我们想赚那笔衍生剧的钱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we're gonna make that spin-off money,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.46,0:30:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就得拿出本事来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she's got to come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.00,0:30:31.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.30,0:30:33.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你不如……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, why don't you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.46,0:30:35.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不如去看看她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you check her out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.17,0:30:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确认她收到信息了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make sure she got the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.04,0:30:38.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.60,0:30:43.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whew.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.54,0:30:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.18,0:30:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得收拾好自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to pull your shit together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.48,0:30:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.96,0:30:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, what is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.66,0:30:59.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以前像条鲨鱼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You used to be like a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.46,0:31:01.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼神死板，没有情绪，没有弱点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dead eyes, no emotion, no weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.53,0:31:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在看看你。对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now look at you. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.96,0:31:04.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的站在他那边？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you honestly taking his side?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.46,0:31:06.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为那家伙基本上是想把我逼下悬崖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because the guy basically tried to drive me off a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.50,0:31:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please. Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.47,0:31:10.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这戒指不错。是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a nice ring. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.60,0:31:11.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:13.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特和我现在在一起了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet and I are together now,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.47,0:31:15.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你最好忍一忍，做好你的工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so you need to suck it up and do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.71,0:31:19.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，那到底是做什么？我想弄清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, right. Which is what, exactly? Just want to clarify.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.14,0:31:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我去亚当的房间，说服他去做一件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want me to go into Adam's room and convince him to do something
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.08,0:31:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他根本不想做的事，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that he doesn't want to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.41,0:31:25.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。这又不是什么新鲜事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, yeah. Since when is that news?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.95,0:31:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，那你希望我怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, how would you like me to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.55,0:31:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你拿走了他的酒庄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because you've taken away his winery.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.26,0:31:31.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把它变成了《永恒之爱》主题乐园。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've turned it into the "Everlasting" theme park.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.62,0:31:34.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你又让我把他拉回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now you're asking me to get him back on board
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.09,0:31:35.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟他的家人和好，可他讨厌他们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with his family, whom he loathes,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.56,0:31:38.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，他们也不怎么待见他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, quite honestly, they're not crazy about him, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.30,0:31:41.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干嘛让亚当搅得你心神不宁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you letting Adam get up all in your vag?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.10,0:31:43.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不过是个道具，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a prop, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.74,0:31:49.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为也许我只是厌倦了当个操控别人的贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because maybe I'm just sick of being a manipulative bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.68,0:31:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.11,0:31:53.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我告诉你，亲爱的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, let me tell you, sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.01,0:31:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反抗这个没意义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there's no sense fighting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.62,0:31:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就是这样的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.72,0:32:03.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.69,0:32:08.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去当操控别人的贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To be a manipulative bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.49,0:32:09.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行就是不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No means no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.66,0:32:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非这能让你得到想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless it gets you something you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.63,0:32:13.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.06,0:32:15.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如你的酒庄……亚当·克伦威尔酒庄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is your vineyard... Adam Cromwell Winery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.27,0:32:17.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做梦。现在那儿是《永恒之爱》水疗度假村了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fat chance. It's the "Everlasting" spa and resort now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.67,0:32:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你告诉切特你愿意做《皇室之恋》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not if you tell Chet you're gonna do "Royal Love."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.77,0:32:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但只做成《皇室改造》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But only as "Royal Renovations."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.58,0:32:26.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你跟节目谈成协议，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you cut a deal for the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.34,0:32:28.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坚持让他们在酒庄拍摄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you insist that they shoot it at the vineyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.15,0:32:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们用整季时间翻修它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we spend the entire season renovating it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.65,0:32:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放到网上，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and putting it online,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.22,0:32:33.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不签约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you are not gonna commit
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:35.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非年底把酒庄拿回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}unless you get the vineyard back at the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.42,0:32:37.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说的是那个有格调的克伦威尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am talking about the classy Cromwell one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.26,0:32:39.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是那个俗气的《永恒之爱》。那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not talking about the cheesy "Everlasting" one. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.66,0:32:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这又要花你一年时间，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I know that it's another year of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.43,0:32:45.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但到最后，你想要的一切都能得到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but at the end of it, you get everything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.33,0:32:46.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，说说看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:49.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我这不会让你父亲刮目相看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me that that's not gonna impress your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.14,0:32:51.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实这主意不赖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's actually not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.37,0:32:55.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但在真人秀上结婚？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But getting married on reality TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.11,0:32:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，算了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.31,0:32:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。那你选安娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. So you pick Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.38,0:33:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你向她求婚，然后就拖着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You propose to her, and then you just put it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.31,0:33:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让她当你一年未婚妻。有什么大不了的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So she's your fiancée for one year. Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.72,0:33:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你花一年时间跟一个美丽、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You spend a year of your life with some beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.78,0:33:08.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}聪明、性感的女人在一起，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}smart, sexy woman, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.72,0:33:11.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，节目结束后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, when the show's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.09,0:33:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以……你想怎样都行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you can... You can do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.79,0:33:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用结婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.29,0:33:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not unless you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.83,0:33:19.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。假设我感兴趣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. So let's say I was interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.46,0:33:22.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。我需要做什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. What would I need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.13,0:33:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只需要把安娜追回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just got to get Anna back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.14,0:33:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.54,0:33:34.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.21,0:33:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这也许算得上咖啡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This might qualify as coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.71,0:33:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你那个鸟不拉屎的州也许算，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from whatever fly-over state you came out of,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:40.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我绝不会喝这乡下猴子尿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but there is no way I'm drinking this hillbilly monkey piss,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.39,0:33:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以赶紧跑去街角给我买杯真正的拿铁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so get your butt down to the corner and get me a real latte.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.49,0:33:46.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.62,0:33:49.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你个建议……别对奎因百依百顺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Word of advice... Don't roll over for Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.76,0:33:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她喜欢有人顶她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She likes the pushback.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.23,0:33:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，别……别对她不尊重，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, don't... Don't be disrespectful,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.33,0:33:55.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但下场跟她过过招，乐一乐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but get in the ring, have a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.37,0:33:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我不怕奎因，如果你是这个意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm... I'm not scared of Quinn, if that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.24,0:34:01.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。怪不得她每次开口你都发怵，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Guess that's why you flinch every time she talks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.64,0:34:04.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不在乎奎因怎么跟我说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't really care how Quinn talks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.64,0:34:07.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直想进入这一行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have wanted to be in this business
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.25,0:34:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从我还是个小女孩起就想，现在我做到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}ever since I was a little girl, and here I am doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.12,0:34:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}助理的光鲜生活，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Glamorous life of a P.A., huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.12,0:34:15.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}暂时而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.26,0:34:19.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.89,0:34:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嗨。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.26,0:34:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，那个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.53,0:34:26.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟莉齐分手了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I broke up with Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.76,0:34:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？你认真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You what? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.67,0:34:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算……你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you gonna... Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.84,0:34:34.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，瑞秋，我好得不得了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Rach, I'm more than okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.61,0:34:37.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我只是厌倦了无视显而易见的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I was just sick of ignoring the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.44,0:34:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么显而易见的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.45,0:34:41.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.15,0:34:45.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……我不……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just... I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.92,0:34:48.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我甚至不确定……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not even sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.23,0:35:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在确定了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sure now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.63,0:35:05.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位……两分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, people... Two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.17,0:35:06.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.47,0:35:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收工后，在你的车里见我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After wrap, meet me in your truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.31,0:35:13.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，会很棒的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, it's gonna be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.78,0:35:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.31,0:35:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.69,0:35:23.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位，开始！各就各位！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, guys, here we go! Places, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.29,0:35:24.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开机！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And action!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.42,0:35:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好，欢迎收看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good evening, and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.79,0:35:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚豪宅里气氛伤感，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a sad night here at the mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.79,0:35:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们剩下的四位选手之一\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as one of our four remaining contestants
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.76,0:35:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将要离开我们……抱歉打断你，呃，格雷厄姆……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}will be leaving us... I'm sorry to interrupt you, uh, Graham...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？……不过有件事，呃，我想一吐为快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes?...but there's something, um, I would like to get off my chest
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.53,0:35:36.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在淘汰环节之前，如果可以的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before the elimination, if that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.60,0:35:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然可以，亚当。什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, Adam, yes. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.47,0:35:42.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，安娜，我今天约会时的行为不可原谅，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Anna, my behavior on our date today was inexcusable,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.37,0:35:44.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们能不能单独待一会儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I was wondering if we might have a moment alone together
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.64,0:35:45.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在仪式开始之前。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.84,0:35:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然可以。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.28,0:35:50.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.38,0:35:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}A机，跟着安娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"A" cam, stay with Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.85,0:35:55.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}B机拍亚当，拉全景，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Adam on "B" cam go wide, please? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.37,0:36:10.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天的事我很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am sorry about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当时心情很糟，我想让你知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was upset, and I wanted you to know
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.60,0:36:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那跟你没有关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that it had nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.67,0:36:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:24.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候真的让人喘不过气……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just overwhelming sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.45,0:36:25.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要记住自己是谁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}trying to remember who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.82,0:36:28.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这堆乱七八糟里想要什么，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and what I want in the middle of all this, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.39,0:36:29.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很容易忘记\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's easy to forget
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.62,0:36:32.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我其实也有真实的感情和渴望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I actually have real feelings and desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.82,0:36:35.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最不可思议的是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what's crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.26,0:36:37.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你和我之间有火花。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is that I know that you and I have a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.56,0:36:41.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我……我真的很想花时间去探索它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I... I'd really like to take the time to explore that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.73,0:36:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So would I.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.27,0:36:45.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.30,0:36:49.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就这么做吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.72,0:37:05.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特，你看这个。看……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet, look at this. Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.69,0:37:08.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。呃，切特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Uh, Chet?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.70,0:37:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做好选择了吗，亚当？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you made your choice, Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.34,0:37:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，做好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.79,0:38:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不觉得意外。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't say I'm shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.60,0:38:21.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这整档节目简直是在可耻地浪费我的时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This entire show has been an obscene waste of my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.50,0:38:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.77,0:38:27.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我最后一个姑娘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that's the last of my girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.91,0:38:29.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我走了。  -再见，杰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm out.   -Bye-bye, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.61,0:38:31.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，伙计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.64,0:38:33.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，杰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.11,0:38:38.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下季见，姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you next season, chica.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.52,0:38:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.69,0:38:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽量别炸掉什么东西，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try not to blow anything up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.58,0:39:40.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。那个故事晚点再讲给我听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Tell me that one later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.55,0:39:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.71,0:39:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.72,0:39:47.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.69,0:39:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.85,0:39:50.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们该尽快结婚……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should get married as soon as we can...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.92,0:39:52.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等文件一办好就结。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As soon as the papers come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.72,0:39:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们，去维加斯，猫王模仿秀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Us, Vegas, Elvis impersonator.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.79,0:39:58.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这么办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.16,0:40:00.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's amazing. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.14,0:40:09.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.24,0:40:11.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。你有事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.64,0:40:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.88,0:40:15.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是过来看看你是不是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wanted to come by and see that you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.88,0:40:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都还好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}okay with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.72,0:40:19.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，高兴得尾巴都翘上天了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, like a dog with two tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.89,0:40:22.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会得到我想要的一切，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gonna get everything I ever wanted, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.62,0:40:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，看来你和安娜进展得很顺利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, it seems like things went really well with Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.49,0:40:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，很顺利。她……她很可爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. It did. She's... she's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.86,0:40:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我们才约会了两次，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we've been on two dates, and what...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.83,0:40:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就要彼此承诺整整一年……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna commit to each other for an entire year...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.23,0:40:37.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当，别这样。万一我发现她把我逼疯呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam, come on. What if I find out she drives me insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.57,0:40:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者我把她逼疯。到时候怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or I her. What're we gonna do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.17,0:40:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}硬撑一年？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just fake it for a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.17,0:40:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.78,0:40:45.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这根本不是感受什么或者假装什么的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not even about feeling anything or faking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.54,0:40:47.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是关于得到你想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just about getting what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.28,0:40:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我得不到我真正想要的怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if I can't have what I truly want?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.52,0:41:01.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}＊初吻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* First kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.53,0:41:02.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.66,0:41:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}＊尝一尝枪管的味道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Taste the barrel of the gun
